# Frontend Rules (Next.js 15 + Payload CMS 3)

## Server vs Client Components
```
Server Components (default):
- Pages (app/**/page.tsx)
- Layouts (app/**/layout.tsx)
- Data fetching components
- Payload CMS API calls

Client Components ('use client'):
- Interactive UI (drag-drop editor, modals, forms)
- State management (zustand stores)
- Browser APIs (localStorage, window)
- Event handlers (onClick, onChange)
```

## Data Fetching Pattern (Server)
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Payload Local API in Server Components
import { getPayload } from 'payload'
import config from '@/payload.config'

export default async function SitePage({ params }: Props) {
  const payload = await getPayload({ config })
  const site = await payload.find({
    collection: 'sites',
    where: { tenant: { equals: tenantId } },
  })
  return <SiteRenderer site={site.docs[0]} />
}
```

## Data Fetching Pattern (Client)
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: TanStack Query for client-side data
import { useQuery, useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'

export function useBlocks(pageId: string) {
  return useQuery({
    queryKey: ['blocks', pageId],
    queryFn: () => fetch(`/api/pages/${pageId}`).then(r => r.json()),
  })
}

export function useUpdateBlock() {
  return useMutation({
    mutationFn: (data: UpdateBlockDTO) =>
      fetch(`/api/pages/${data.pageId}`, {
        method: 'PATCH',
        body: JSON.stringify(data),
      }).then(r => r.json()),
    onSuccess: () => toast.success('Block đã được cập nhật'),
    onError: () => toast.error('Không thể cập nhật block. Thử lại'),
  })
}
```

## Component Pattern (3 States Required)
```typescript
export function BlockList({ pageId }: { pageId: string }) {
  const { data, isLoading, isError, refetch } = useBlocks(pageId)

  if (isLoading) return <BlockListSkeleton />

  if (isError) return (
    <Alert variant="destructive">
      <AlertDescription>
        Không thể tải blocks.{' '}
        <Button variant="link" onClick={() => refetch()}>Thử lại</Button>
      </AlertDescription>
    </Alert>
  )

  if (!data?.length) return (
    <EmptyState
      icon={<LayoutGrid />}
      title="Chưa có block nào"
      description="Thêm block từ thư viện bên trái"
      action={<Button>Thêm Block</Button>}
    />
  )

  return <div>{data.map(b => <BlockEditor key={b.id} block={b} />)}</div>
}
```

## Form Pattern (Zod + react-hook-form)
```typescript
const siteSettingsSchema = z.object({
  name: z.string().min(1, 'Tên website không được trống'),
  description: z.string().max(160, 'Mô tả tối đa 160 ký tự'),
  primaryColor: z.string().regex(/^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$/, 'Mã màu không hợp lệ'),
})

type SiteSettings = z.infer<typeof siteSettingsSchema>
```

## Theme System
- Global theme (colors, fonts) applies to entire tenant site
- Per-block variant selection (not per-element styling)
- CSS variables for theme tokens: `--primary`, `--font-heading`, `--font-body`
- Dark/Light mode toggle via CSS variables, not duplicate styles

## Payload CMS Admin Customization
- Custom views go in `src/app/(payload)/admin/`
- Custom components for blocks in `src/components/admin/`
- Use Payload's `useField`, `useForm` hooks inside admin components
